        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs one stamina, and reaching zero stamina costs a life before restoring stamina. Walls and blocked directions prevent movement, so blocked_directions must be checked every turn. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation modifiers turn the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. A goal activates only when shape, color, and rotation all match; stepping onto it completes the goal. Completing all goals advances the level, while losing all lives ends the game."
